<title>SINGAPORE: ABSA Singapore unit offers property finance.</title>
<headline>ABSA Singapore unit offers property finance.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amalgamated Banks of South Africa Ltd (ABSA) said on Tuesday its Singapore branch had launched a financing scheme for Asian investors seeking to buy property in South Africa.</p>
<p>The financing will be available to qualifying non-resident buyers in U.S. dollars against legal mortgages on South African property for up to 70 percent of the property's value, ABSA said in a statement. Repayments will be over a five-year period.</p>
<p>The bank said it had already received a number of enquiries following the soft launch of the scheme at a recent South African residential property exhibition in Hong Kong.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
